# Onderon, the Royal Palace, General Vaklu, and back to Dxun (TSL, 506OND,
# 401DXN, 003EBO): Bostuco keeps the Palace intersection, Tobin shuts the
# capital-ship door on the Exile and sets the drexl on the throne room's
# force field; the south hall (the mines, the security wing's troops, the
# Vaklu captain questioning Riiken, the four droids), Kiph's door
# [Security]ed, Kiph the slicer asked why and let go (LS), the primary
# security terminal: every security door opened, the area schematics,
# Riiken's force cage opened, Riiken heard, then the primary override code
# taken and the terminal shut down; back by the south hall and north: the
# museum, the gas room's metal box, Master Kavar's greeting, Kadron's armory
# locker, the storage room's number puzzle (66, 45, 39), its crystals,
# footlockers and the locked metal box [Security]ed; Captain Kadron given
# the override code (the outer door opened, the Exile taken to it); Tobin
# at the inner door, the drexl loose and killed; the throne room's battle
# joined by Battle Meditation, Kavar's entry, Vaklu beaten and the Queen
# left to judge him (Kreia +INF), Talia talked out of executing him by
# [Persuade]; Kreia heals Tobin and sends him to the Sith; Kavar's answers
# and his form, Talia's thanks and the museum's relics. Back on Dxun the
# squads reunite (Onderon has one leader now), aboard.
# Starts from the Palace's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @onderon_royal_palace data/routes/tsl/finale_palace.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Onderon Royal Palace"; GameBanshee 52
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the museum's relics looted (Talia gives its four instead, talia E3),
# the gas room's terminal, the secondary terminal's cameras, the boobytrapped
# consoles (sec_term_boom@1, @2), Kavar asked about Katarr.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - The party is the Exile, Kreia and Mandalore; the Queen's side
#   (500OND_DarkSide_Iziz 0): Tobin locked inside, Kadron and Kavar in the
#   north wing, Kiph and the caged Riiken in the south (DSimpson's order:
#   south first).
# - Bostuco's arrival talk starts itself (k_506_enter).
# - door_secsouth (Kiph's room) is Locked (OpenLockDC 28, no key): the
#   Exile's Security.
# - termeast start 1 needs Kiph's room taken (c_local_notset, else
#   "TERMINAL LOCKED BY ANOTHER USER"); the override reply (R15) needs
#   Riiken freed and heard (c_other_set: g_riiken's local 52), the transfer
#   reply (R17) Kadron talked to (c_dline_check), which this order never
#   offers.
# - Riiken's tag is g_riiken (a_end_game moves "g_riiken"; he is not in the
#   GIT); freed, he speaks when used.
# - The north wing's doors (door_gas, door_secnorth) open after "Open all
#   security doors."; tr_security_north is Kavar's greeting (kavar start 1).
#   The route goes back by the south hall and north through the museum and
#   the gas room, DSimpson's way.
# - Kadron's "I'll head there immediately." (a_dline_pctele) puts the Exile
#   at wp_bgone_pc by the opened outer door, and Tobin's start 1 plays.
# - The throne room: thronecs at tr_royal_battle (R3, the Battle Meditation
#   replies need the power), kaventer at tr_kavar_enter (Kavar paralyses the
#   fighters), then vaklu start 0; Vaklu downed ends the fight (start 1).
# - a_end_game: 506OND_End, OndMov06, 401DXN From_506OND; k_401enter starts
#   the reunion with the Dxun squad, which a_end_reunion ends with Kreia and
#   Visas Marr (403DXN_PARTY2_NPC1) in the party.
talk                 # Bostuco: "We've made it to the Palace" (k_506_enter)
say Any door can be opened, Tobin. This isn't over.
to tr_tobin_door     # Tobin shuts the outer door (tobin start 0, the drexl)
talk
fight 40             # the grand hall
use OnderonDoor03@3  # the south hall: its mines
fight 40
use door_palsecurity # the security wing (tr_security_room)
fight 40
to tr_capt_interr    # the Vaklu captain at Riiken's cage (va_capt start 1)
talk
fight 40
use OnderonDoor03@4  # the droid room
to tr_droid_attack   # Kiph's last surprise: the four droids wake
fight 40
unlock door_secsouth # Kiph's room: Locked, [Security] DC 28
use door_secsouth
fight 40             # the Vaklu captain's men
say Why would you work with General Vaklu? # Kiph (not "Give me a reason I
say [Awareness] I don't believe a word you've said. # E26 (c_sc_awa_gt)
say [Awareness] I can tell you aren't lying about that. # E28, E29
say I need access to the console. # shouldn't kill you": its first reply
say =Just leave.     # is "You set off one trap too many", DSP)
use kiph
say [Computer] Access system commands. # termeast start 1, DSimpson's two visits:
say [Computer] Open all security doors.
say [Computer] Open force cage. # Riiken freed (a_rd_termset)
say [Computer] Upload area schematics.
say =Log out.
use pl_termeast
say How do I do get the code? # (sic) Riiken (mp_riike) out of his cage: the
say I'll see to it right now. # override reply waits on his word (c_other_set 52)
use g_riiken
say [Computer] Access system commands.
say [Computer] Access primary override code and shutdown terminal. # (250 XP)
use pl_termeast
use OnderonDoor03@3  # back by the south hall to the intersection, then north
use door_gas@1       # the museum's door (its relics are Talia's gift, talia E3)
fight 40
use door_gas@2       # the gas room
fight 40
use MilMidMetalBox@1 # the gas room's metal box (DSimpson's; the MetalBoxes by it
                     # are not useable)
use door_secnorth    # the north hall
fight 40
to tr_security_north # Kavar: "Come in, quickly" (kavar start 1)
talk
use locker_armory    # Kadron's armory ("take anything from the armory lockers")
say [Computer] Open the storage door. # term_puz: the storage room's number puzzle
say [Computer] Repair corrupted key sequence.
say =66              # twice it exceeds its half by 99
say =45              # reversed, a fifth more
say =39              # less its reverse by twice its digits' product
use sec_term_puzz
use door_puzzle
use box_puzzle       # the storage room's crystals
use MilMidFootLker@1 # its footlockers and boxes
use MilMidFootLker@2
use MilLowFootLker
unlock MilMidMetalBox@2 # the locked metal box [Security], DC 18 ("should have
use MilMidMetalBox@2 # some lightsaber crystals")
say I have the override code for the primary security console already.
say I'll head there immediately. # a_dline_pctele: to the opened outer door
use kadron           # Captain Kadron (ro_weed)
say Not today, Tobin. # tobin start 1: the drexl breaks the inner field
to tr_last_tobin     # past the opened outer door (a_dline_bkill)
talk
fight 40             # the Drexl Larva
say Join the battle. # thronecs (not the Battle Meditation replies)
to tr_royal_battle
talk
fight 40
say Did I miss anything? So you must be General Vaklu. # vaklu start 0
say You have underestimated what a Jedi is capable of.
say Although I respect your council, Kreia, the decision is the Queen's not mine. # vaklu start 1 (+INF)
say He's right, your majesty. What sort of moral authority # Talia talked out
say [Persuade] If you kill him, you make him a martyr. # of the execution
to tr_kavar_enter    # Kavar enters the throne room (kaventer), Vaklu's taunt
talk
fight 30             # Vaklu and his men: Vaklu downed ends it (vaklu start 1)
talk                 # his fate left to the Queen, then Kreia heals Tobin (506kreia)
say You've answered all my questions. # Kavar (start 2), then his form
use npc_kavar
talk                 # lrn_form: Kavar's form; "I'm going to Dantooine."
talk                 # Talia's thanks, the museum's relics (a_end_game)
module 401dxn        # OndMov06, From_506OND
say The political situation on Onderon has been dealt with. # reunion
talk
to to_ebonhawk       # aboard
module 003ebo
save onderon_won
